{"path":"container/flat_map/replace","title":"std::flat_map<Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer>::replace","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::flat_map&lt;Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer&gt;::</span>replace","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/flat_map/replace","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Replaces the underlying containers c. Equivalent to:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> replace<span class=\"br0\">(</span> key_container_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> key_cont, mapped_container_type<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> mapped_cont <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Replaces the underlying containers <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_map#Member_objects\"><code><i>c</i></code></a>. Equivalent to:\n</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code>c.<span class=\"me1\">keys</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>key_cont<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\nc.<span class=\"me1\">values</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>mapped_cont<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<p>The following conditions must be met:\n</p>\n<ul><li> The expression <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">key_cont.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> mapped_cont.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>,\n</li><li> The elements of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">key_cont</span></code> are sorted with respect to <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_map#Member_objects\"><code><i>compare</i></code></a>, and\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">key_cont</span></code> does not contain equal elements.<p> Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</p></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> keys_cont\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a sorted keys container of type <code>KeyContainer</code>, the contents of which will be moved into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> mapped_cont\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a container of mapped values of type <code>MappedContainer</code>, the contents of which will be moved into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Equals to complexity of <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/move\"><code>std::move</code></a> applied to adapted containers.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;flat_map&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;print&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> keys<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/is_sorted\"><span class=\"kw3019\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">is_sorted</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>keys<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> values<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu16\">2.2</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">3.3</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">1.1</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>keys.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> values.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_map\"><span class=\"kw3359\">std::<span class=\"me2\">flat_map</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> map<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>map.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    map.<span class=\"me1\">replace</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>keys, values<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>map.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>map.<span class=\"me1\">keys</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>map.<span class=\"me1\">values</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>keys.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>values.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{}\"</span>, map<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>{1: 2.2, 2: 3.3, 3: 1.1}</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_map/extract\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>extract</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  extracts the underlying containers <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/flat_map","title":"std::flat_map"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::flat_map<Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer>::replace","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Replaces the underlying containers c. Equivalent to:"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"keys_cont, mapped_cont"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Equals to complexity of std::move applied to adapted containers."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"extract","note":"extracts the underlying containers"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":171,"codeBlockCount":3}
